---
title: "EKSIR / ISOC: alert pipeline, persona synthesis and the human gate"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    %% =====================================================================
    %% Last reviewed against the codebase: 2026-09-04
    %% Source of truth: pipeline/orchestrator.py (run_pipeline step list),
    %% pipeline/synthesis_graph.py + synthesis_steps.py, routes/cases.py
    %% Regenerate the PNG (mermaid-cli is not a repo dependency):
    %%   npx -y -p @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli mmdc \
    %%     -i docs/rag-pipeline-sequence.mmd -o docs/rag-pipeline-sequence.png \
    %%     -p docs/puppeteer.json -b '#0d1117' -w 2400 -t dark
    %% =====================================================================
    participant SRC as Alert source<br/>(webhook · pull connector · batch)
    participant API as ISOC API<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant W as ARQ worker<br/>(orchestrator)
    participant E as bge-m3<br/>(Ollama embedder)
    participant Q as Qdrant<br/>(vector memory)
    participant TI as Enrichment<br/>(triage.py · TI feeds · ipinfo)
    participant EDR as EDR / XDR APIs<br/>(per-tenant creds)
    participant G as LangGraph<br/>(persona synthesis)
    participant LLM as LiteLLM<br/>(fast / deep tier)
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant AN as Analyst

    SRC->>API: POST /v1/ingest/{source} (HMAC) or cron pull_ingest
    API->>W: enqueue pipeline_run(incident_id)

    Note over W,DB: 1. parse: normalize to OCSF (pipeline/ocsf.py + connector parsers)
    W->>DB: status = PARSED

    Note over W: 2. auto_close_pre: YAML rules, pre-enrichment
    W->>DB: AUTO_CLOSED_CANDIDATE (or continue)

    rect rgb(40, 30, 60)
    Note over W,Q: 3. dedup: RAG recall, scoped to the same customer
    W->>E: embed(embed_text)
    E-->>W: dense vector (1024d)
    W->>Q: hybrid search (dense + sparse, RRF fused)
    Q-->>W: EXACT_MATCH (cosine >= 0.90)
    Q-->>W: N_WAY agreement (>= 3/5 priors, same tenant)
    Q-->>W: SIMILAR (top-k priors + their verdicts)
    end

    rect rgb(30, 45, 60)
    Note over W,EDR: 4. enrich: deobfuscate, then run the branches concurrently
    W->>W: deobfuscate (base64 / encoded payloads) then re-extract IOCs
    W->>W: apply analyst exclusions (ip · cidr · domain · hash · email domain)
    par
        W->>TI: triage(IOCs) VT · AbuseIPDB · OTX · MalwareBazaar · ThreatFox
        TI-->>W: IOC reputation rows
    and
        W->>TI: whois / rDNS / geo per public IP
        TI-->>W: IP enrichment
    and
        W->>Q: kb_search(rule, customer)
        Q-->>W: KB hits (runbooks · allowlists · assets)
    and
        W->>EDR: Vision One workbench + OAT autofetch (read-only, flagged)
        EDR-->>W: workbench detail
    end
    Note right of W: return_exceptions=True: one dead branch never sinks the rest
    end

    Note over W,DB: 5. entities: resolve OCSF entities into the entity store
    Note over W,DB: 6. correlate: cluster related incidents

    Note over W: 7. decision gate
    alt Confident: exact match · n-way agreement · auto-close
        W->>DB: DECIDED_SHORT_CIRCUIT: no deep LLM spend
    else Ambiguous, sensitive rule, or any TP
        W->>DB: AWAITING_SYNTHESIS
    end

    rect rgb(30, 50, 40)
    Note over W,LLM: 8. synthesis: LangGraph persona graph (MemorySaver checkpointer)
    W->>G: run_synthesis_graph(incident)

    G->>LLM: L1 fast classifier (briefing.py markdown)
    LLM-->>G: TriageResult {verdict, confidence, reason}
    opt Obvious low/med FP at HIGH confidence
        G->>DB: DECIDED_SHORT_CIRCUIT: auto-closed, no gate
    end

    G->>EDR: pre-L2 prefetch (Microsoft reputation · endpoint · identity)
    EDR-->>G: deterministic MS enrichment slices
    G->>LLM: L2 deep synthesis with read-only tools
    LLM->>EDR: defender_run_hunt · get_machine · file/ip stats · lookup_ioc_history
    EDR-->>LLM: tool results (surfaced on the incident timeline)
    LLM-->>G: markdown report + fenced AnalysisVerdict JSON

    opt agent_routing.should_hunt
        G->>LLM: hunt persona (focus from L2)
        LLM-->>G: HuntResult (queries + reasoning, live KQL when enabled)
    end
    opt agent_routing.should_run_forensics
        G->>LLM: forensic persona
        LLM-->>G: timeline + root cause
    end

    G->>G: manager (deterministic): map verdict, build proposal + proposed_actions
    G->>G: scoring.py: fused confidence + effective threat (0-100)
    G->>DB: AWAITING_SIGNOFF (verdict still PENDING)
    end

    Note over G,AN: Personas only PROPOSE. Nothing is committed yet.

    rect rgb(60, 40, 20)
    Note over AN,API: 9. Human sign-off gate: the only commit point
    API-->>AN: incident parked at the gate (proposal + scores + actions)
    opt Manager chat
        AN->>API: POST /incidents/{id}/manager (directive)
        API->>LLM: manager_chat tools: revise verdict/actions, re-task hunt/forensics
        LLM-->>API: revised proposal (still uncommitted)
    end
    alt Approve
        AN->>API: POST /incidents/{id}/approve (+ checked action ids)
        API->>DB: commit verdict + audit entry
        API->>Q: index verified verdict (RAG feedback loop)
        API->>EDR: run approved actions (isolate · scan · blocklist · disable_user)
        API->>EDR: verdict write-back / status mirror (flagged)
    else Reject
        AN->>API: POST /incidents/{id}/reject
        API->>W: requeue=true: pipeline_synthesize_only, else AWAITING_REVIEW
    end
    end

    Note over Q: Today's approved verdict becomes tomorrow's exact-match prior:<br/>the same alert then short-circuits at step 3 with no LLM spend.
